    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.6.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.6.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said to Moses, \"Now you will see what I will do to Pharaoh: Because of my mighty hand he will let them go; because of my mighty hand he will drive them out of his country.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God also said to Moses, \"I am the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.6.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.6.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I appeared to Abraham, to Isaac and to Jacob as God Almighty,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "but by my name the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.6.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.6.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I did not make myself fully known to them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I also established my covenant with them to give them the land of Canaan, where they resided as foreigners.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moreover, I have heard the groaning of the Israelites, whom the Egyptians are enslaving, and I have remembered my covenant.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Therefore, say to the Israelites: 'I am the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.6.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.6.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and I will bring you out from under the yoke of the Egyptians. I will free you from being slaves to them, and I will redeem you with an outstretched arm and with mighty acts of judgment.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will take you as my own people, and I will be your God. Then you will know that I am the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.6.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.6.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God, who brought you out from under the yoke of the Egyptians.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will bring you to the land I swore with uplifted hand to give to Abraham, to Isaac and to Jacob. I will give it to you as a possession. I am the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.6.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.6.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses reported this to the Israelites, but they did not listen to him because of their discouragement and harsh labor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.6.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.6.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said to Moses,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Go, tell Pharaoh king of Egypt to let the Israelites go out of his country.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Moses said to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.6.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.6.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", \"If the Israelites will not listen to me, why would Pharaoh listen to me, since I speak with faltering lips",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Family Record of Moses and Aaron",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.6.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.6.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "spoke to Moses and Aaron about the Israelites and Pharaoh king of Egypt, and he commanded them to bring the Israelites out of Egypt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "lh"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These were the heads of their families",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": ":",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b",
        "vid": "EXO 6:14"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "EXO 6:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The sons of Reuben the firstborn son of Israel:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "EXO 6:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hanok and Pallu, Hezron and Karmi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "lf",
        "vid": "EXO 6:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "These were the clans of Reuben.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
